'''Ability''' is a unique [[Status_Effects#Triggers|unit trigger]] in Monster Train 2. It is manually activated by clicking on the unit. Each ability has a cooldown; most abilities can only be used once every 2-3 turns.

Each unit can only have one ability. Applying an ability to a unit that already has one (such as with [[Tome of Evergrowth]]) overwrites the old ability with the new one.

